### API status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### Add income
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "type": "income",
  "category": "Salary"
}

### Add expense
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 45.90,
  "type": "expense",
  "category": "Food"
}

### Get all transactions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions/

### Filter by type and date
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions/?type=expense&start_date=2026-09-01&end_date=2026-09-30

### Budget summary
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/budget/summary

